OL,3,GNEWSACoalition deal collapses after
OL,4,AZionism row fallout
OL,5,
OL,6,FStafford Borough Council will be run as
OL,7,Fa minority administration after the
OL,8,Flocal Labour group ended its coalition
OL,9,Fagreement with the Green Party over a
OL,10,Fpolicy defining Zionism as a form of
OL,11,Fracism.
OL,13,FIt follows a decision made by Labour HQ
OL,14,Fto end power-sharing agreements with
OL,15,Fthe Greens on local councils unless
OL,16,Fcouncillors disowned the party's newly
OL,17,Fadopted national policy.
OL,19,FThe leader of the Green group in
OL,20,FStafford, councillor Doug Rouxel, said
OL,21,Fthey "resolutely refused" to meet those
OL,22,Fconditions.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
