OL,3,GNEWSACoalition deal collapses after
OL,4,AZionism row fallout
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour leader Aidan Godfrey said in
OL,7,Fa statement it was "disappointing" and
OL,8,Fmeant the group could not continue to
OL,9,Fwork with the Greens.
